# Route: guide 30 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 52 to
# 53, 36 quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Burning Steppes, Duskwood, Swamp of Sorrows, Blasted Lands, Westfall):
# Ruins of Thaurissan -> Blackrock Stronghold -> Ruins of Thaurissan ->
# Dreadmaul Rock -> Blackrock Mountain -> Ruins of Thaurissan -> Darkshire ->
# Splinterspear Junction -> Stonard -> The Shifting Mire -> Fallow Sanctuary
# -> The Shifting Mire -> Itharius's Cave -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Nothing But The Truth (1383;
# Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider Searcher 39-40).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dark Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024),
# Precarious Predicament (4121), The Heart of the Mountain (4123), Egg
# Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735).

